<Base title="About Minute Cryptic Answer Today" description="About this unofficial fan site for daily Minute Cryptic hints and answers.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About this site</h1>
    <p>
      Minute Cryptic Answer Today is an unofficial fan site. Every day we post the Minute Cryptic clue, a set of hints
      that get more direct as you go, and the answer with an explanation of how the clue works.
    </p>
    <p>
      We are not affiliated with or endorsed by Minute Cryptic. The puzzles are written by the Minute Cryptic team and
      its members, and you can play them for free at
      <a href="https://www.minutecryptic.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">minutecryptic.com</a>.
      If you enjoy the puzzle, consider supporting the people who make it.
    </p>
    <p>New answers go up shortly after midnight Eastern time.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Spotted a mistake? Email <a href="mailto:hello@minutecrypticanswertoday.com">hello@minutecrypticanswertoday.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
